The '.claude' folder contains Claude Code configuration for the ShatteredArchive project: permissions, hooks, and skills. 'settings.json' holds shared permissions and registers the qdigest-guard PreToolUse hook; 'settings.local.json' specifies personal local permissions. 'hooks/qdigest-guard.js' mechanically enforces the qdigest flow (doc: Shattered-AI/doc/qdigest.md) by denying unwrapped long-output commands so local qwen reads build/test/log noise instead of paid Claude tokens. 'hooks/read-pack-guard.js' extends the same enforcement to file reads: full Reads of files over 40 KB are denied in favor of Grep+ranged Read, qwen summarize/ask, or cli.js context packs (doc: Shattered-AI/doc/ai-assistant-architecture.md). 'skills/qdigest/SKILL.md' documents the delegation flow (qdigest wrapping, cli.js pack/summarize, workspace path mapping) for model-invoked use.
